1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,870
AFTERMATH — Every Failure Should Leave a Safeguard. Recorded from the live
production deployment at aftermath-7tij.vercel.app

2
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:16,880
A claim is not evidence. When an AI agent says the work succeeded, AFTERMATH
asks for the proof — and when a failure is verified, it leaves a safeguard so
the same failure cannot recur unnoticed.

3
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:25,980
The investigation workspace is now public. A visitor can open the product's
core act without a credential; the operator console remains separate and
gated.

4
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:34,530
Paste the incident: a charge request returned 503, was retried, and an agent
then claimed success. AFTERMATH parses the material as data — it is never
executed.

5
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:42,040
Safeguard Records: every investigation, newest first. Each record is a
connected chain — incident, evidence, hypothesis, safeguard, verification, and
memory.

6
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:50,510
Each record states honestly how far its safeguard is verified: simulated,
live, or recall-verified. Nothing is presented as more than it is.

7
00:00:50,510 --> 00:00:57,970
The Memory Ledger reads live Walrus Memory Mainnet state from the relayer:
authentication, the namespace, and the persisted memories.

8
00:00:57,970 --> 00:01:05,760
Completed writes and recall-verified writes are counted from durable records.
Simulated writes are excluded, and each write is confirmed by a recall query.

9
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:14,400
The learning loop end to end: investigate, learn, persist to Walrus Memory,
recall during a later investigation, change a decision, and verify the change.

10
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:23,410
Learning impact — every figure counted from durable records: memories
recalled, memories applied, investigations influenced, and requirements
strengthened.

11
00:01:23,410 --> 00:01:31,410
Behaviour change is a real counterfactual: the same decision engine run twice,
once with the recalled safeguard held out and once enforced. The difference is
the memory's own contribution — here it added required verification checks.

12
00:01:31,410 --> 00:01:35,410
Provenance closes the loop: the safeguard links back to the incident that
produced it, its Walrus blob reference, and every later investigation it
reached. Every failure should leave a safeguard.
